  illustration: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 872d56a8a0a20b447bd0cb71b1caa2f1, type: 3}
  storyText: 'In a strange universe, there is a world called Hopix, where everything
    is made of cubes. Mountains, rivers, trees, and houses all have square shapes,
    yet the world is full of life and harmony. At the center of Hopix lies the World
    Core, a powerful source of energy that keeps the entire world stable.


    In
    a small village built of stone and wood, Leo lives a quiet and peaceful life,
    never knowing that his world is about to change.'
